&Q000516

{1 = 1-9}
1.	O @wDN{An}, strengthen the foundations of the throne of life. 
2.	@wRN{Rīm-@wDN{Sîn}}, 
3.	may your name be called by a name of life; 
4.	may he look upon you with favourable eyes, 
5.	and pay attention to you. ($@gap{1 line unclear}$) 
6.	May he determine a destiny of life as a fate for you. 
7.	@wRN{Rīm-@wDN{Sîn}}, may you be beloved of @wDN{An}, and may your kingship endure forever. 
8.	Great @wDN{An}, 
9.	make him shepherd of the numerous people. 
